From a288295ac2e17e0356d9b7206b2aa1b61b8690be Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 02:31:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Autotracking from SwitchWaker (?autotrack=)

The tracker polls the game's state (SwitchWaker's COS_TRACKER_SERVER, GET /state) once a
second and merges it in: items set when the game's count changes, small keys gained added,
locations and salvaged charts' sunken treasures checked, never unchecked. Turned on with
?autotrack=1 (the game on 127.0.0.1:6544) or ?autotrack=<address> after the tracker's URL,
and on its own when the game serves the tracker itself (the state next to the page);
?autotrack=0 turns it off.
